{
	"name": "服饰",
	"category": "tfg:craftsmanship",
	"icon": "tfc_textile:cotton_shirt",
	"read_by_default": true,
	"sortnum": 19,
	"pages": [
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"text": "$(item)服饰$()是一类$(thing)装备$()，能提供$(l:game_mechanics/damage_types)盔甲$()之外的效果。$(br2)大多数衣服会影响你的$(l:game_mechanics/player_temperature)玩家体温$()，另一些则能提供额外且实用的效果。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"anchor": "index",
			"text": "$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#curios)关于饰品栏$()$(li)$(bold)早期服饰$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#straw_hat)草帽$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#primitive)原始服饰$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#insulated_leather)皮革$()$(li)$(bold)高级服饰$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#cloth)布料$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#hides)兽皮$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#fully_insulated)完全隔热$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#table)服饰属性表$()$(li)$(bold)其他服饰$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/exploration_gear#snowshoes)雪鞋$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/exploration_gear#snorkel)通气管$()和$(l:logistics/exploration_gear#flippers)脚蹼$()$(li2)$(l:game_mechanics/hazards#mask)面罩$()$(li2)$(l:game_mechanics/hazards#gloves)橡胶手套$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#armor_trim)服饰纹饰$()"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:image",
			"title": "什么是饰品栏？",
			"anchor": "curios",
			"images": [
				"tfg:textures/gui/field_guide/curios.png"
			],
			"border": true,
			"text": "点击角色头像左上角的圆形按钮即可打开菜单。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"text": "服饰可以穿在普通的装备栏里，也可以穿在$(thing)饰品栏$()中，以便同时穿戴其他装备。$(br2)这个菜单里还有$(l:logistics/personal_storage#backpack)背包$()、$(l:logistics/personal_storage#tool_belt)工具皮带$()等物品的槽位。"
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
			"recipe": "sns:straw_knapping/straw_hat",
			"anchor": "straw_hat",
			"title": "草帽",
			"text": "你能合成的第一件服饰是一顶简单的$(item)草帽$()，由$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#thatch)干草$()制成。它能保护你免受$(l:game_mechanics/player_temperature#wetness)阳光直射$()。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"title": "原始服饰",
			"anchor": "primitive",
			"item": "tfc_textile:raw_hat,tfc_textile:raw_shirt,tfc_textile:raw_pants,tfc_textile:raw_socks",
			"text": "在北极冻得瑟瑟发抖、还一丝不挂？$(item)原始$()套装非常容易制作，只需要一些$(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#thatch)干草$()和几张$(item)兽皮$()。尽显穴居人风尚！$(br2)原始服饰的保暖、隔热和耐久都很低，但应该能撑到你找到更好的装备。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:crafting",
			"recipe": "tfg:shapeless/primitive_insulation_small",
			"recipe2": "tfg:shapeless/primitive_insulation_large",
			"title": " "
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
			"recipe": "tfg:knapping/raw_hat",
			"text": "$(l:craftsmanship/sticks_and_stones#knapping)石子塑形$()出$(item)原始兜帽$()。"
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
			"recipe": "tfg:knapping/raw_shirt",
			"text": "石子塑形出$(item)原始托加袍$()。"
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
			"recipe": "tfg:knapping/raw_pants",
			"text": "石子塑形出$(item)原始短裤$()。"
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
			"recipe": "tfg:knapping/raw_socks",
			"text": "石子塑形出$(item)原始靴子$()。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"anchor": "insulated_leather",
			"title": "隔热皮革",
			"item": "tfcambiental:insulated_leather_hat,tfcambiental:insulated_leather_tunic,tfcambiental:insulated_leather_pants,tfcambiental:insulated_leather_boots",
			"text": "$(item)隔热皮革$()衣服比穴居人装扮更进一层。它们只需要一些$(l:agriculture/leather_making)皮革$()盔甲，再加上$(l:agriculture/animal_husbandry#wooly_animals)羊毛$()或$(l:agriculture/animal_husbandry#oviparous_animals)羽毛$()。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:crafting",
			"recipe": "tfg:shaped/insulated_leather_hat",
			"recipe2": "tfg:shaped/insulated_leather_tunic",
			"title": " "
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
			"recipe": "tfg:knapping/leather_apron",
			"text": "$(l:agriculture/leather_making)皮革$()$(item)围裙$()能提供大量隔热效果，却既不保暖也不降温。在$(l:craftsmanship/charcoal_forge)锻炉$()前干活时再合适不过！"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"title": "布制服饰",
			"anchor": "cloth",
			"item": "tag:forge:cloth",
			"text": "想要更强、更长效的防护，你该考虑用各种$(l:agriculture/weaving)布料$()来做些正经衣服了。$(l:agriculture/animal_husbandry#wooly_animals)羊毛$()和$(l:beneath/beneath_crops#cotton)棉花$()衣服会为你保暖，而$(l:the_world/wild_crops#flax)亚麻$()、$(l:the_world/wild_crops#jute)粗麻$()和$(l:beneath/beneath#webbed_lair)丝绸$()衣服则会让你凉爽。$(br)它们的前期投入更大，但耐久高得多，修理起来也很便宜。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:crafting",
			"title": " ",
			"recipe": "tfg:shaped/cotton_shirt",
			"recipe2": "tfg:shaped/burlap_pants"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"item": "tag:tfc_textile:animal_furs",
			"anchor": "hides",
			"title": "兽皮",
			"text": "各种动物的兽皮和毛皮可以用来制作 $(tfg_short) 中最坚固的服饰，拥有所有装备中最佳的属性和耐久。它们的属性各不相同，取决于获取的难度，或者你能在哪里找到相应的动物。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"text": "例如，$(l:the_world/wild_animals#crocodile)鳄鱼服饰$()会让你凉爽，而一件$(l:the_world/wild_animals#caribou)驯鹿皮大衣$()则会让你暖烘烘的。$(br2)最强的降温服饰则需要去一趟$(l:beneath/beneath_mechanics#clothes)相当炎热$()的地方……$(br2)这些服饰也都能轻松修理。"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:crafting",
			"title": " ",
			"recipe": "tfg:shaped/caribou_shirt",
			"recipe2": "tfg:shaped/crocodile_shirt"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"anchor": "fully_insulated",
			"title": "完全隔热",
			"item": "gtceu:nanomuscle_chestplate,ad_astra:space_suit",
			"text": "最后，一些高级盔甲还会提供$(thing)完全隔热$()效果，把外界影响隔绝在外，使你的$(l:game_mechanics/player_temperature)玩家体温$()不会低于 5°C 或高于 25°C。"
		},
